text = "                                                           Story:
Uh oh! Halloween is almost over and the children are fiending for some candy! 
Defend your neighbourhood by throwing candy at the children! Do some 
trick-or-treating while you are at it!
 
                                                         Controls:
W or Up Arrow - Up
S or Down Arrow - Down
A or Left Arrow - Left
D or Right Arrow - Right
Left Click - Shoot
Q - Trick-or-Treat"

